        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PRY1SMTSBR, Brass Pryor Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pryor Brass Pull is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. This modern door pull made from 5/8\" thick solid brass. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. This Brass Pryor Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PRY1SMTSBR Pryor Rectangular Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PRY03-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262376\"><b>First Impressions PRY1SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PRY1018SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PRY1024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PRY1036SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pryor Brass Pull",
                "description": "The Pryor Brass Pull is available in a wide array of beautiful finishes. This modern door pull made from 5/8\" thick solid brass. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. This Brass Pryor Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
